## ⚙️ Dependencies / Requirements

- Python 3.x
- Jupyter Notebook
- pandas, numpy, matplotlib, seaborn
- scikit-learn, TensorFlow, Keras (for ML/DL modules)

> Tip: For full dependencies, see requirements.txt (add this file if missing).

---

## 🧩 Installation Instructions

```
# Clone the repo
git clone https://github.com/KavanKumarpatel/DATA-SCIENCE.git

# (Optional) Set up a virtual environment
python -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate   # For Mac/Linux
venv\Scripts\activate      # For Windows

# Install dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

---

## 🚀 How to Run

- Open Jupyter Notebook in the repo folder:
  ```
  jupyter notebook
  ```
- Select any module's notebook to start exploring!

